<span aria-hidden="true" class="chapter-toggle">+</span></summary><div class="chapter-body prose"><figure class="content-photo"><img alt="paver patio design aurora" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/paver-patio-design-aurora.webp"/></figure></div>
